### Feature ServiceOrderItems — UPDATE (JWT + RBAC)
@baseUrl = http://localhost:4000
# access_token: POST /api/sesion/login (features/auth/session/http/session.http) o npm run dev:token -- admin
@token = pega-aqui-el-access-token

### PUT (cantidad y peso)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/detalle-ordenes/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "quantity": 15,
  "weight_kg": 6
}

### PATCH (solo peso)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/detalle-ordenes/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "weight_kg": 7.5
}
